	(descr "Panasonic EVQP44B3M side-operational edge-mount tactile switch, 6.2 x 2.55 x 3.5 mm, LCSC C79164. Pads TRACED from Panasonic ANCTB27E (2016.09) page 2, \"PWB land pattern for reference\", short-push-travel variant: contacts 1/2 are 1.45 x 1.05 mm on 6.0 mm outer / 3.1 mm inner span, sitting 2.05-3.1 mm from the PWB edge; anchor tabs 3/4 are 0.6 x 0.8 mm on 7.0 outer / 5.8 inner span, 0.45-1.25 mm from the edge; push plate faces the edge. Footprint frame: +X toward the board edge, edge at x = +1.725. Tabs carry no net.")
